<title>NORWAY: Handelsbanken on R.S. Platou takeover.</title>
<headline>Handelsbanken on R.S. Platou takeover.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Handelsbanken Norge said on Monday it would hold a news conference at 1100 GMT in connection with its takeover of the activities of Norwegian brokerage house R.S. Platou Securities.</p>
<p>Handelsbanken Norge is the Norwegian subsidiary of Svenska Handelsbanken.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
